From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 548/550] media: mediatek: add the MT6797 sensor interface's
 master clocks

Each timing generator in the sensor interface drives one master clock pad,
divided from CAMTG. Expose them as clocks, so a sensor driver can use its
ordinary clock path. The receivers in the same block come later.

The register use follows the vendor's kernel and observation of its
userspace camera library: phase counter and clock enable in the first
register, the divider and edges in the second.
